{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up confined in a dimly lit room, surrounded by cold screens. A distorted voice breaks the silence \u2014 the Dealer. He offers you a deal: answer one question correctly, and you\u2019ll earn your freedom. But if you succeed, he\u2019ll tempt you with something greater \u2014 money, power, and the thrill of risking it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round is a gamble. You can walk away with your winnings or play for higher stakes, knowing one mistake means death. Bet money on trapdoors to increase your chances \u2014 or trust your instincts. The machine decides your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Twitch chat integration, global leaderboards, and an endless loop of temptation, <i>Fate Dealer</i> turns knowledge into survival and greed into damnation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far will you go for a million dollars\u2026 or your life?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb2 High-stakes quiz gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151150/extras/61643cd535f6833c340583765e5dbc4a.poster.avif?t=1770302713\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151150/extras/61643cd535f6833c340583765e5dbc4a.webm?t=1770302713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151150/extras/61643cd535f6833c340583765e5dbc4a.mp4?t=1770302713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >one wrong answer, and you die.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcb0 Progressive rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151150/extras/ba76ca83585729361ff1b30416115d4f.post